ichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Jul 2017."}]},{"text":"Bolas then blasted Bontu, calling her usefulness ended, and she burst free of the undead, freed Hazoret, and died.","cites":["favor-2017-07-05-e13","favor-2017-07-05-e15","favor-2017-07-05-r1"],"links":["https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Slowly%2C%20he%20raised%20one,bolt%20of%20dark%20energy.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Bontu%20fell%2C%20the%20dragon%27s,god%20to%20this%20world.","https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=the%20dragon%27s%20necrotic%20spell,god%20to%20this%20world."],"citations":[{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Favor","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-07-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Slowly%2C%20he%20raised%20one,bolt%20of%20dark%20energy.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Favor\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Jul 2017."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Favor","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-07-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Bontu%20fell%2C%20the%20dragon%27s,god%20to%20this%20world.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Favor\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Jul 2017."},{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Favor","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-07-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=the%20dragon%27s%20necrotic%20spell,god%20