03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Pay%20the%20toll%2C%20or%20fall%20short%20and%20perish.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e23","summary":"Bontu drains Gideon's strength with her gaze and commands him to watch while Djeru finishes the killing.","participants":["bontu","gideon-jura","djeru","meris"],"location":"bontu-s-monument","importance":"minor","page":"stories/brazen-2017-05-03","order":159,"story_date":"2017-05-03","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":194,"quote":"Watch, Kytheon Iora. Quiet your judgment, and learn.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Watch%2C%20Kytheon%20Iora.%20Quiet%20your%20judgment%2C%20and%20learn.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Brazen","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-05-03","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=Watch%2C%20Kytheon%20Iora.%20Quiet%20your%20judgment%2C%20and%20learn.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Brazen\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 3 May 2017."}},{"id":"brazen-2017-05-03-e24","summary":"Gideon furiously denounces the slaughter and dives across to confront Bontu, who calls him brazen and ignorant of her world.","participants":["gideon-jura","bontu","djeru"],"location":"bontu-s-monument","importance":"major","page":"stories/brazen-2017-05-03","order":159,"story_date":"2017-05-03","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":202,"quote":"What mockery of faith and divinity is this madness?","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/brazen-2017-05-03#:~:text=What%20mockery%20o