ory, Wizards of the Coast, 28 Jun 2017."}},{"id":"favor-2017-07-05-e0","summary":"Hazoret feels a third god die and kneels in despair, knowing only she and Bontu remain.","participants":["hazoret","bontu"],"location":"naktamun","importance":"minor","page":"stories/favor-2017-07-05","order":167,"story_date":"2017-07-05","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":10,"quote":"Bontu and I are all that remain.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Bontu%20and%20I%20are%20all%20that%20remain.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Favor","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-07-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=Bontu%20and%20I%20are%20all%20that%20remain.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"Favor\" by Michael Yichao. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 5 Jul 2017."}},{"id":"favor-2017-07-05-e8","summary":"Bontu kneels, hails Nicol Bolas by name and declares her servitude, revealing she has served him and culled dissenters.","participants":["bontu","nicol-bolas","hazoret"],"location":"naktamun","importance":"major","page":"stories/favor-2017-07-05","order":167,"story_date":"2017-07-05","storyline":"Amonkhet","source":"wizards","paragraph":60,"quote":"I have culled dissenters from all the crops","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=I%20have%20culled%20dissenters%20from%20all%20the%20crops","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"Favor","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Michael Yichao"],"date":"2017-07-05","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/favor-2017-07-05#:~:text=I%20have%20culled%20dissenters%20from%20all%20the%20crops","archived":null,"lic